# Body and facial tracking

Status: DONE
Milestone: M1
Dependencies: 01_FOUNDATION.todo

## Purpose
Track a single performer's full visible body and expressions from the same camera frame.

## Tasks
- [x] MediaPipe pose joints/world points and segmentation-derived outline.
- [x] Original-resolution pose-guided face crop and fallback acquisition.
- [x] Blinks/winks, mouth opening, smile, brows and head pose.
- [x] Confidence, freshness, cropped limbs, anatomical sides and filtering.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Real model inference and normalized-contract tests pass; invalid/off-frame/low-confidence
  joints are excluded. Model confidence itself is not ground-truth visibility.

## Completion evidence
- Actual front-facing fixture:33 pose points,16/16 face detections, contour and world estimates.
- Crop:24 eligible points, both ankles omitted; profile:body detected but face unavailable.
- Same-session input translation, blank loss and reacquisition passed. See docs\05-validation.md.

